{"message":"The table defines cash flow for each year, with figures in millions of dollars. To get the average cash flow from 2004 to 2006, I will average the three annual cash flow values: 2006 = 957.4, 2005 = 769.1, 2004 = 950.4.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"(957.4 + 769.1 + 950.4) / 3","sources":{"2006 cash flow":"source:t3c1n0","2005 cash flow":"source:t3c2n0","2004 cash flow":"source:t3c3n0"}}}